  (text "POWER INPUT\nVehicle supply 9-30 V on J1 pin 8 (VIN_IN, Harness sheet); the return is the J1 GND pins 1 and 2.\nF101 PTC -> D103 reverse block -> D104 TVS (SMAJ30CA) -> U101 LM2596S-ADJ, 5.29 V on +5V_PSU (R103/R104 = 3.3k/1k).\n+5V_PSU -> D101 SS34 -> +5V. USB VBUS is OR-ed into +5V on the esp32-core sheet.\nVIN_SENSE = VIN x 5.6/105.6 (GPIO34, ADC1_CH6). H102-H105 = board corner holes."
    (at 25 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "ea2c38cf-ed67-4ac3-b0a6-3b1ca6dc279e")
  )
